    {
        "text": "8:36 P.M. \\ Rainy \\ Visibility: 12 km",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_ri_1",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "fadetime": 0.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Welcome back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I already heard what happened from the recon squad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, let me check your hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no need for that, Dr. Kal'tsit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...All right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks fine. The rings haven't cracked or discolored.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it might be different next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Listen closely, Amiya...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Be a little more careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I need some rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never put Amiya in this much risk again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are also responsible for what happened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you first came back to Rhodes Island, she looked a bit like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "These emotions never really left Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "This has to change.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Dr. {@nickname}, you should stay with her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't mess up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "*knock* *knock*",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's open.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_rhodesroom",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. {@nickname}...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Worried? I am?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#10"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You saw right through me, hehe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought I did a good job hiding it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'm a bit worried... just a little, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm already used to doing this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, I can't drag down everyone else any more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor... I don't understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "(Stay silent)",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I... I know what we're trying to do. I also know... that some sacrifices are inevitable.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I... what I don't know is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why must I watch people disappear before my eyes one by one... even though they can be saved?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were so close... Maybe just a little bit more...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know that I have a duty... and I will continue to move forward...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "But right now... I just feel so tired.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "...;Amiya...",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Please let me have some time alone, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_ri_1",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$tech_intro",
        "key": "$tech_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good morning, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Dr. Kal'tsit, you're here as well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a rather urgent mission here, and need some people to help out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "An abandoned city was discovered not far from Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I surmise that it's one of the cities that formed in the aftermath of the Chernobog incident.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have to explore that city, uncover more information, and search for any survivors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the situation is particularly serious, for example, if Reunion is hiding there, then there may be serious ramifications on our future operations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's the specific proposal that I have in mind. Look over it when you have time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, one more thing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka submitted a report to me mentioning that they had to return to Blacksteel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the situation in the Lungmen slums, Penguin Logistics requested for you to meet them there to discuss some information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are some more sensitive details, so it'd be best for you to go in person.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. I'll head over right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, let's go--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I still have some things to discuss with Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "May I listen in?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You may not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I can cover my ears...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You cannot. You should get going.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Aww...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, you're not allowed to bully Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I won't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You couldn't even do something so basic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it, I had a feeling this would happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya is an incredibly resilient kid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, if she has to force herself to be strong, there will come a day when the pressure breaks her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do not let this happen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If there is a next time, you'd better be a little more useful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "--?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's with that face?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Excuse me, but what do you mean by Amiya's rings...?;...",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's related to the state of her health.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "If Amiya is involved in an intense battle...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You must check her rings immediately afterwards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what changes you see, you must report them to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "fadetime": 1.2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For the time being, that's all you're allowed to know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, right. You have to go down to the medical center in two days to have a physical done. Don't forget it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You can go. Liskarm is waiting outside to escort you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]